00:01:32.370 --> 00:01:34.780
Jackpot!

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:36.530
Certificate: Grand Prize

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:40.120
Amazing!

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:41.510
Way to go, Haruna!

00:01:41.510 --> 00:01:44.320
Oh! This is awesome!

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:48.070
It’s an invitation for ten people to go to a southern island resort!

00:01:48.070 --> 00:01:49.520
Thanks!

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:52.130
Would you like to come with us too, Yami-Yami and Mikado-sensei?

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:54.680
It sounds way better than a pool.

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:56.470
It sounds interesting.

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:58.880
Haruna-san, are you planning to go on a trip?

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:01.030
That's great. Isn't it, Sairenji-san?

00:02:01.030 --> 00:02:02.210
Who are you going with?

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:03.270
With everyone!

00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:07.060
It’s an invitation for ten people so it doesn't matter, right?

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:08.910
B-But I...

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:12.130
Ah! Were you planning to go with the person you like?!

00:02:12.130 --> 00:02:14.390
What? N-No, I wasn't...

00:02:14.390 --> 00:02:18.360
Haruna, the certificate says ten guests are invited...

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:22.110
But it's limited only to girls!

00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:24.760
It's perfect for us then!

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:26.910
Everyone! She said she'll take us along!

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:28.830
All right!

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:30.840
Thank you very much!

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:32.380
A-Are you sure it’s all right?

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:35.270
In that case, we'll take you up on your offer.

00:02:35.270 --> 00:02:36.090
Indeed.

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:38.420
H-Hey, wait a second.

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:44.860
Oh, sorry! Didn't I tell you I'm going to Los Angeles with some friends?

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:46.610
For two weeks starting tomorrow...

00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:48.150
So there you have it.

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:50.080
No problems!

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:54.020
Let's go to Lala-chi's place for the last two invitations!

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:00.840
Welcome to the Resort!

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:03.320
Lala-chi! Let’s go!

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:04.830
Lala-san!

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:07.470
Ah, Sairenji.

00:03:07.470 --> 00:03:10.850
Lala, Mikan! Everyone's here!

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:12.200
Oh, Yuki-kun.

00:03:12.490 --> 00:03:14.870
I’m really sorry about this, but...

00:03:14.870 --> 00:03:16.640
It's fine, it's fine.

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:19.230
Since both my older sister and I are going to be gone,

00:03:19.230 --> 00:03:21.040
I have to leave him here.

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:24.420
I’ll be by myself, anyway. This way I won’t be lonely.

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:27.040
But those two sure are taking their sweet time.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:29.810
Hey, Mikan! Lala!

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:32.280
Lala-san! Let’s go!

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:34.560
Ah! Wait a second!

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:42.980
Just where did I put that thing?

00:03:41.410 --> 00:03:44.100
Hey! What are you doing, Lala?

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:45.490
Everyone's waiting!

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:46.990
Man, what are you doing?

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:50.140
Lala-san, where's your luggage?

00:03:50.140 --> 00:03:51.270
Down there!

00:03:51.270 --> 00:03:54.350
Ah, sorry, Mikan! I’m coming right now!

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:57.940
You're a life-saver,

00:03:57.940 --> 00:03:58.960
Mikado-sensei!

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:02.390
Jeez, if we don’t hurry up, the plane is going to take off!

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:03.980
We need to be on time!

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:05.180
Yeah, we do...

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:07.010
Huh? Where's Yami-Yami?

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:12.400
Looks like she went on ahead.

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:16.020
Well, whatever. There’s no time left anyway.

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:18.580
Ah, sorry, Rito! I’ll clean up after I come back!

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:20.080
Hey, you’re just going to leave it like this?

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:21.490
Sorry!

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:23.900
What am I going to do?

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:26.700
I can't get into my room!

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:45.340
Jeez! Everyone's already in the car!

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:49.700
Hey, should I bring this bag too?

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:51.210
Yes please!

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:53.110
Got it.

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:57.630
Rito! I’m off!

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.230
Mikan, wait up!

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:01.220
You're so slow!

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:02.990
You should keep track of time!

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:04.360
Sorry!

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:05.800
You guys didn't forget anything, right?

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:06.940
Nope!

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:09.120
Then, let’s go!

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:13.750
Sensei! You’re driving too fast!

00:05:18.590 --> 00:05:23.170
Lala-chi! If we die, it’s all your fault!

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:25.460
Haha, we’ll be fine!

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:26.620
Don’t be giving me your “haha!"

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:28.540
Lala-san!

00:05:39.990 --> 00:05:42.020
No one else's onboard!

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:45.340
It's a charter flight! It's free!

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:47.530
As expected from the Tenjouin Group!

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:49.950
Huh? There are ten of us, right?

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:52.010
Who was supposed to sit next to you?

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:59.020
Unfortunately, Run-chan got caught up by her gravure photo session, so she couldn't come with us.

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:01.000
Oh? That’s too bad.

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:08.090
Cut {it off}!

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:16.380
She said something about having swimsuit photos taken at a snowy mountain.

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:19.440
She also said it was to help cool down the summer staff members.

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:22.170
That doesn’t seem very fun.

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:26.430
If it’s a swimsuit photo shoot, then it would’ve been better if they shot it at the southern islands, right?

00:06:26.910 --> 00:06:30.270
You're really lucky, Haruna!

00:06:30.270 --> 00:06:33.000
Yeah, that’s right! Lucky, everyone!

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:39.350
Welcome, winner of the Tenjouin Group’s Refreshing Summer Lottery, Sairenji-sama, and company.

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:44.930
The escort queen, Tenjouin Saki-sama, will be your tour guide escort today.

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:49.040
Yes, I am the escort queen, Tenjouin Saki!

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:53.830
Taking us to the private island is this Tenjouin 747-400 modified private jet.

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:52.760
It’s Saki.

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:56.000
So Tenjouin-senpai is Tenjouin...

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:57.140
The trip will take approximately 45 minutes...

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:57.140
Is this some sort of joke?

00:06:57.140 --> 00:07:00.320
Hey, pay attention when people are talking!

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:03.250
You people should just shut up and watch the monitor!

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:07.700
We are currently headed toward Tenjouin family’s private island.

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:12.580
An island where only girls are allowed while boys aren't! Please enjoy it to your heart’s content.

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:15.640
That’s why this was a girls only tour.

00:07:15.640 --> 00:07:16.480
Yeah.

00:07:16.480 --> 00:07:17.950
Oh, what now?

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:20.780
I was looking forward to a risque beach adventure...

00:07:20.780 --> 00:07:24.530
Maybe Tenjouin-senpai swings that way?

00:07:24.530 --> 00:07:25.730
No, I don’t!

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:28.150
I told you to pay attention to what I'm saying!

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:29.990
This is free so don't complain!

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:36.750
Anyway, please savor this private island that your average commoner could never ever enjoy.

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:41.630
What was that? She was just bragging.

00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:48.060
Basically, this is a sample of the girls only island they're planning to put out on the market.

00:07:48.060 --> 00:07:50.690
So that's the reason for the ten of us.

00:07:50.690 --> 00:07:54.650
That’s right. I reported it to you all through the monitor.

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:54.540
She's here?!

00:07:54.650 --> 00:07:57.030
Enjoy it thoroughly, all right?

00:08:11.640 --> 00:08:16.460
{Tenjouin Resort}

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:15.410
Cool!

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:18.800
So cool! It’s so pretty!

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:21.070
Marvelous!

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:22.540
Thanks so much, Haruna!

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:23.850
This is the best!

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:26.680
Let’s play, everyone!

00:08:29.180 --> 00:08:31.740
To the hotel! Go go!

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:36.210
Wah! This is just amazing!

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:37.740
This totally feels like a resort!

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:40.090
This is heaven!

00:08:40.090 --> 00:08:44.210
Wow, the view from this room is great too!

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:45.340
How's it over there?

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:46.870
It's the best!

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:47.880
Oh, that’s right.

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:51.960
Mikado-sensei told us to change into our swimsuits and gather at the beach.

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:53.630
Okay!

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:56.400
Ah! That’s so cute!

00:08:56.400 --> 00:09:00.560
Hmm, but it’s different from what I imagined it to be!

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:03.640
Huh? Did I put the bottom half in my bag?

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:05.540
Isn't it in that bag?

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:06.600
That bag?

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:10.480
Hmm?

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.560
I had a bag like this?

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:16.250
When we left, I asked you if I should bring it and you told me to.

00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:17.500
Oh, that’s right!

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:19.700
What did I put in here?

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:23.370
Ah, could this be?

00:09:29.570 --> 00:09:33.110
Ah! What is this?! Where am I?

00:09:33.110 --> 00:09:34.760
What?!

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:40.740
The bag changed into Maron!

00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:44.060
Ah! This is the Maru Maru Animal Bag-kun!

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:46.620
One of your items changed him into a bag?

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:51.570
That’s strange, I don’t think I fixed it since it broke...

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:53.440
Let me explain.

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:59.670
Rito-dono stepped on the Maru Maru Animal Bag-kun.

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:04.990
Which is an item that can change into a bag without having to skin an animal for it.

00:10:04.890 --> 00:10:06.850
When it's not being used, it returns back to normal.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:12.540
Since this is Lala-sama’s invention, it mixed things up.

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:14.350
Rito-dono and...

00:10:14.350 --> 00:10:16.800
Figure it out! It’s me, Rito!

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:28.820
Lala-san! Mikan-chan!

00:10:28.820 --> 00:10:30.150
Are you ready?

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:36.190
Eh? Maron?

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:39.010
Isn't that puppy your Maron-chan?

00:10:39.010 --> 00:10:40.200
Yeah.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.410
Why are you here?

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:45.910
Haruna-chan! Please understand, Haruna-chan!

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:48.730
Jeez, how did you follow us here?

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:54.880
It's because of my invention. Even though you planned to leave him with Rito, we brought him thinking he was a bag.

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:57.380
I-I see.

00:10:57.380 --> 00:11:00.190
Is that how it is?

00:11:00.190 --> 00:11:02.890
By why did I become Maron?

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:06.900
Well, it is Lala-sama’s invention, after all.

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:10.970
Well, we might be violating the rules since Maron's a male.

00:11:10.970 --> 00:11:14.050
But now it's exactly ten people, so I guess it’s fine.

00:11:14.050 --> 00:11:15.220
All right! {I’ve apparently put on a few pounds, thanks a bunch, animators}

00:11:15.220 --> 00:11:16.540
Let’s go then!

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:19.180
Lala-san, have you decided on a swimsuit yet?

00:11:19.180 --> 00:11:21.490
Oh, I forgot.

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:28.490
It’s the sea.

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:34.460
We did it.

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:36.170
Oh, no.

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:40.130
Lend me more of your body.

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:43.290
Whispering to the

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:46.200
cloudy sky.

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.970
Tomorrow’s

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:50.850
pool.

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:54.420
The end of summer vacation.

00:11:54.430 --> 00:11:57.840
Hey, Mr. Sun.

00:11:57.840 --> 00:12:01.530
Is called rain

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:02.380
Non-stop!

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:05.870
The hot, hot sun

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:09.880
Take in everything.

00:12:09.880 --> 00:12:12.990
Even I... Even I...

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:13.540
Fake

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:14.670
Oh? Why you!

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:16.670
Love it!

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:41.940
See? That's why I told you!

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:47.870
Love is a pain in the butt!

00:12:48.430 --> 00:12:53.230
Love or hate, whatever is fine.

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:58.880
It’s not unfair for him or her

00:12:58.950 --> 00:13:02.420
Television is loss and numbing

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:03.100
I’m dying inside

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:03.760
I’m also dying outside

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:05.340
I’m not turning a blind eye

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:07.800
Bags of potato chips

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:10.860
Grip it tightly

00:13:10.980 --> 00:13:14.090
Before you do it correctly

00:13:14.090 --> 00:13:17.300
Change into your bikini

00:13:17.300 --> 00:13:20.690
Please don't destroy our hopes and dreams

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:22.400
Tell me softly

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:25.050
Go for it!

00:13:25.050 --> 00:13:28.410
Today is a wonderful day!

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:30.650
Let’s make it today. Tide

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:37.060
I’m okay even if I'm covered in scars, I’m fine!

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:41.830
Youth!

00:13:51.090 --> 00:13:54.300
No! It's not like that

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:57.130
My heart is thumping

00:13:59.160 --> 00:14:02.320
That's because I hate

00:14:02.630 --> 00:14:05.360
You, who are so shameless

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:10.390
Don't look at me so gently

00:14:11.170 --> 00:14:21.020
In order to preserve myself, I turn the other way

00:14:22.150 --> 00:14:26.490
The real "inside" of a girl

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:25.000
Let go of me, Lala!

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:30.140
Is a secret place to everyone

00:14:30.350 --> 00:14:34.500
I want to know, but because I'm scared

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:38.430
There's no way to be kind

00:14:38.430 --> 00:14:42.460
The truth is always hidden

00:14:43.170 --> 00:14:46.320
within the real "inside"

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:50.610
Wonder if the mystery can be solved someday?

00:14:50.900 --> 00:14:55.370
Am I being weird today?

00:15:10.400 --> 00:15:14.510
The truth is always hidden

00:15:15.090 --> 00:15:18.420
within the real "inside"

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:22.560
Wonder if the mystery can be solved someday?

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:27.230
I want to ask you...

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:49.230
Ah! It’s so pretty!

00:15:49.230 --> 00:15:50.780
It really is!

00:15:50.780 --> 00:15:52.130
Lala-san!

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:55.590
Hurry up and come inside! It’s super delicious!

00:15:57.280 --> 00:15:59.120
Let’s go in, Yami-chan.

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:02.730
It’s a beautiful view, isn’t it.

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:06.130
Being able to see something like this is...

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:09.510
I’m glad I could come.

00:16:09.510 --> 00:16:10.990
Thank you very much.

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:15.350
Yeah, it's great we could all come. Right, Haruna?

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:18.730
C’mon, let’s go eat dinner!

00:16:18.730 --> 00:16:20.480
Yami-chan, let’s go.

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:21.500
Okay.

00:16:22.230 --> 00:16:26.680
Come, everyone! Tonight’s main dish is lobster!

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:29.000
Yay!

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:31.690
That was delicious. Right, Maron?

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:43.510
Is Maron-chan outside already?

00:16:43.510 --> 00:16:45.400
Oshizu-chan, welcome back.

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:46.520
I’ll close the door immediately.

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:49.000
Sorry about this.

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:51.110
Don’t worry about it.

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:54.010
Maron, be a good boy.

00:16:54.520 --> 00:16:57.250
Haruna-san, what about the bath?

00:16:57.250 --> 00:17:00.540
I’m up for it. But you can go first, Oshizu-chan.

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:04.970
Well... You see, I don’t know how to use the baths here.

00:17:04.970 --> 00:17:07.280
In that case, let’s go in together!

00:17:07.280 --> 00:17:09.100
That’s a great idea!

00:17:09.100 --> 00:17:11.050
Haruna-chan!

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:13.990
This is like a dream come true!

00:17:13.990 --> 00:17:16.590
No! What am I thinking?!

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:22.600
I’m sorry for making you wash my back for me.

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:27.230
You listened to a lot of what I had to say,

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:28.310
so this is nothing.

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:30.190
Is that so?

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:33.530
Has your chest gotten a bit bigger?

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:38.000
Huh? I-I don’t think they’ve changed...

00:17:35.940 --> 00:17:38.800
Oh, I've got a great idea!

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:41.460
Momioka-san and the others taught me this.

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:43.020
W-Wait.

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:43.760
See?

00:17:43.760 --> 00:17:45.490
If we do this, the difference will...

00:17:45.490 --> 00:17:48.380
Yep, it feels like they’ve gotten bigger!

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:50.170
Is that so?

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:55.720
But, is this really all right?

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:10.080
Ah, this feels great!

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:13.910
Haruna-san, since you’re this lucky with lotteries,

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:15.960
I’m sure you’re also dead on in terms of romance!

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:17.860
Eh? That's not true...

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:21.370
It’s all right! I'm cheering you on!

00:18:25.960 --> 00:18:28.080
Ah, that was great!

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:30.320
That felt great, didn’t it!

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:32.090
Hm? What’s wrong?

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:37.400
Oh my! Everything from inside the bag is messed up!

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:43.130
H-Haruna-san! What's with this string panty?!

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:45.640
It’s almost like a man’s fundoshi!

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:48.810
That’s my sister’s underwear!

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:51.580
Why are there holes exposing your behind?

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:53.680
You’ve got a bunch of different types, huh?

00:18:53.680 --> 00:18:55.850
Those aren't mine!

00:18:55.850 --> 00:18:58.450
Amazing! So soft!

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:00.110
M-Maybe it is?!

00:19:00.110 --> 00:19:01.700
Can I try them on?

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:02.280
Huh?!

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:07.140
This is kind of comfortable.

00:19:07.140 --> 00:19:11.360
Yeah, but we really should clean up here.

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:13.720
Next time, I’ll go buy this.

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:16.130
You've taken a liking to it...

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:17.820
Maron!

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:23.930
Stop it, Maron!

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:26.130
Stop it!

00:19:32.320 --> 00:19:36.520
Ah, not again!

00:19:44.230 --> 00:19:45.620
Stop it!

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:48.110
No! My undies!

00:19:48.110 --> 00:19:49.910
Oh! Stop it, Maron!

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:54.600
No! Stop!

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:05.160
Ah! Maron!

00:20:05.160 --> 00:20:07.400
Why is he inside the room?

00:20:07.400 --> 00:20:09.580
I’m so sorry, Oshizu-chan!

00:20:09.580 --> 00:20:10.810
Maron? Maron?

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:17.690
Maron! Jeez, you shouldn't do that!

00:20:18.360 --> 00:20:20.690
Eh? Haruna-chan?

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:23.980
Jeez, you're so helpless...

00:20:23.980 --> 00:20:25.550
What?

00:20:25.550 --> 00:20:27.160
What’s going on?

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:31.290
O-Oshizu-san!

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:33.320
Why is Haruna-chan hugging me?

00:20:33.320 --> 00:20:34.960
I passed out...

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:37.340
Hey, are you listening?

00:20:37.950 --> 00:20:39.970
Ah! Haruna-chan!

00:20:39.970 --> 00:20:42.790
Really, you shouldn’t have followed us.

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:44.680
Just bear with it, okay?

00:20:45.460 --> 00:20:47.650
Goodnight, Maron.

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:55.240
How should I come to grips with this?!

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:59.530
Ah! Why am I here...?

00:20:59.530 --> 00:21:01.690
Why am I here as Maron?!

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:03.070
That time!

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:06.240
Lala’s invention...

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:11.750
Lala-san, are you all right?

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:14.330
Hehe, I sneezed.

00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:20.890
Lala’s invention did this!

00:21:23.980 --> 00:21:26.160
Now, everyone!

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:29.010
Let’s have plenty of fun today too!

00:21:29.010 --> 00:21:30.600
Yeah!

00:21:37.670 --> 00:21:42.940
Please don't hesitate, please don't trick me.

00:21:43.770 --> 00:21:48.860
Say it, who do you love?

00:21:49.860 --> 00:21:55.080
Two Eves and one Adam

00:21:55.080 --> 00:22:00.570
It feels like there is going to be a storm in heaven.

00:22:01.610 --> 00:22:07.780
It's a selfish and still sour fruit

00:22:07.780 --> 00:22:10.340
To get you to put it against your lips...

00:22:10.340 --> 00:22:15.210
To the point that it's embarrassing, I WANT YOU

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:19.520
Gulp!

00:22:19.520 --> 00:22:25.610
Bite it and see! Hurry, hurry

00:22:25.610 --> 00:22:31.160
You might get dizzy from the sweet smell

00:22:43.040 --> 00:22:45.100
Haruna-chan.

00:22:45.100 --> 00:22:47.150
We’re all going to the jacuzzi.

00:22:47.150 --> 00:22:48.510
Let’s go, Maron.

00:22:48.510 --> 00:22:50.130
Eh? That means...

00:22:50.780 --> 00:22:53.050
The pool was great fun, wasn’t it?

00:22:53.050 --> 00:22:55.970
My, my. That's not the only pool, you know?

00:22:55.970 --> 00:22:58.380
Oshizu-chan, you’re pretty tanned, aren’t you?

00:22:58.380 --> 00:23:00.750
Even artificial bodies can get tanned?

00:23:00.750 --> 00:23:01.960
What about her butt?

00:23:01.960 --> 00:23:03.730
Check!

00:23:03.730 --> 00:23:06.230
Wow, Lala-chi! You’re also pretty amazing!

00:23:07.030 --> 00:23:09.100
Oh? What about Mikado-sensei?

00:23:09.100 --> 00:23:10.310
Something like this.

00:23:10.310 --> 00:23:12.300
I expected nothing less from sunbathing in the nude.

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:13.910
There are no marks at all!

00:23:13.470 --> 00:23:15.290
Hey, stop it already!

00:23:15.290 --> 00:23:16.790
How about you, Yui?

00:23:16.790 --> 00:23:18.790
Hey, wait!

00:23:16.930 --> 00:23:18.790
You turned out great!

00:23:18.790 --> 00:23:19.830
Jeez!

00:23:19.830 --> 00:23:21.030
And lastly...

00:23:21.050 --> 00:23:23.030
How about Haruna?

00:23:23.030 --> 00:23:26.070
Let’s see those tan lines!

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:27.960
Are you ready?

00:23:27.960 --> 00:23:32.470
I can't handle it!

00:23:33.480 --> 00:23:35.470
Hey, Rito!

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:39.350
I brought the magazines, Rito!

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:43.400
Huh? I wonder if he's home...

00:23:49.200 --> 00:23:50.980
Thanks so much, Haruna!

00:23:50.980 --> 00:23:53.070
This was a totally fun trip!

00:23:54.550 --> 00:23:56.370
I’m...

00:24:08.130 --> 00:24:11.750
Mizutama wo aisare muyou

00:24:08.130 --> 00:24:11.640
Polka dots are the shape of being loved.

00:24:11.750 --> 00:24:15.400
Doko datte ikite yukeru noyo

00:24:11.750 --> 00:24:14.970
I can wear it and go anywhere.

00:24:15.400 --> 00:24:22.270
Taisetsu na watashi no omamori wo tsurete itte

00:24:15.400 --> 00:24:22.270
They're my precious charms. I'll take them along with me.

00:24:22.690 --> 00:24:26.310
Tabi wo shite kimi no moto mate

00:24:22.690 --> 00:24:26.200
Traveling to where you are,

00:24:26.310 --> 00:24:29.900
Nami ni motte gungun dokomade

00:24:26.310 --> 00:24:29.480
tiding the waves steadily anywhere.

00:24:29.900 --> 00:24:34.830
Mizutama wa ii ita wa aisuru to wa toki ni

00:24:29.900 --> 00:24:34.830
The polka dots say "There are times when lovin is unseemly."

00:24:34.830 --> 00:24:43.760
Minikuku mo aru do fumi dasu ashi chiisaku furueru jimen

00:24:34.830 --> 00:24:43.760
I step forward with my foot down on the gently shivering ground.

00:24:45.400 --> 00:24:54.280
Kotae na no iranai kono omoi kienai kana

00:24:45.400 --> 00:24:54.280
I don't need an answer. Will this feeling disappear?

00:24:55.170 --> 00:25:01.110
Hoshi no lullaby utatteru yo kimi to bye bye?

00:24:55.170 --> 00:25:01.110
I'm singing a lullaby for the stars! Can I bring myself to say goodbye to you?

00:25:01.110 --> 00:25:04.690
Dekiru deshou usbuita sora

00:25:01.110 --> 00:25:04.580
An exaggerated sky.

00:25:04.690 --> 00:25:06.350
Usotsuki wa doko

00:25:04.690 --> 00:25:06.350
Where's the liar?

00:25:06.590 --> 00:25:12.060
Mizutama to negatta ima lullaby

00:25:06.590 --> 00:25:12.060
My eyes met polka dots. I'm singing a lullaby now!

00:25:12.060 --> 00:25:15.700
Utatteru you kimi to bye bye

00:25:12.060 --> 00:25:15.700
Surely I won't bring myself to say goodbye to you.

00:25:15.700 --> 00:25:25.870
Dekiru hazu wa nai deshou negai no se kimi ni todoku yo

00:25:15.700 --> 00:25:25.870
Riding on my wishes, they'll reach you!

00:25:25.870 --> 00:25:28.890
Lucky tune!

00:25:25.870 --> 00:25:28.890
Lucky tune!
